{
  "name": "codegraph-panel-mac",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "CodeGraph 认知面板（macOS 版）：CodeGraph 官方没有 UI（codegraph ui 仍提示后续版本提供），本插件在 DSH 会话标签栏补一个 CodeGraph 标签。功能包括索引概览（文件/节点/边/体积/语言/待同步）、符号搜索（按名与类型）、调用关系图（cytoscape 交互图，以符号为中心展开 1-3 跳邻域，按 calls/imports/references/instantiates/extends 着色）、影响面分析（谁依赖我，按跳数分组）、符号详情（元数据 + 源码与调用链），以及一键 sync / 重建索引。图数据直接读 .codegraph/codegraph.db 的 nodes/edges 表（CLI 的 impact 只给平铺节点、拿不到连线），只读打开，不写业务代码。",
  "type": "module",
  "author": "huzijing",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/huu8/codegraph-panel-mac.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/huu8/codegraph-panel-mac",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.1",
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build-client.mjs",
    "check": "node scripts/check.mjs",
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs",
    "install:link": "bash scripts/install.sh"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js",
    "lib/codegraph.js",
    "lib/platform.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation"
      ]
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "cordis",
    "plugin",
    "codegraph",
    "dependency-graph",
    "cytoscape",
    "ui",
    "macos"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/huu8/codegraph-panel-mac/issues"
  }
}
